WEBVTT

00:02:58.196 --> 00:03:01.760
And then you look
at your colleague and say,

00:03:01.784 --> 00:03:04.898
"Why, you cretin!
You put yours in the white bin."

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.546
And we use that as a moral tickle.

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.315
We feel so good about ourselves.

00:03:09.339 --> 00:03:12.594
If we -- well, OK, I'm just ... me.

00:03:12.618 --> 00:03:14.318
Not you, but I feel this way often.

00:03:14.342 --> 00:03:15.976
(Laughter)

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.891
And so we kind of have
this moral feel-good moment.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.126
But if we were to be able
to follow that little bottle

00:03:22.716 --> 00:03:24.181
on its journey,

00:03:24.205 --> 00:03:26.770
we would be shocked
to discover that, all too often,

00:03:26.794 --> 00:03:29.124
that bottle is going to be put on a boat,